{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CommutativeQou","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CommutativeQou","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Braided.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CommutativeQOU.mul_commutes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CommutativeQOU.mul_commutes","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/commutative-qou.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The multiplication is invariant under the braiding on A ⊗ A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CommutativeQOU.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CommutativeQOU.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/commutative-qou.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CommutativeQOU","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CommutativeQOU","kind":"class","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/commutative-qou.lean#L20-L38","doc":"**Commutative QOU**: a QOU together with the structural\nwitness that the Frobenius-Hopf object A is commutative as an\nalgebra object inside the ambient braided category 𝐂.\n\nConcretely: if (A, μ, η) is the algebra structure on A and\nc_{A,A} : A ⊗ A → A ⊗ A is the braiding, then\n  μ ∘ c_{A,A} = μ\nwhich, by self-duality of Frobenius-Hopf, also forces\n  c_{A,A} ∘ Δ = Δ\n(cocommutativity of the coalgebra).\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:commutative-qou}`\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 3, §Varying Euler + mirror bundle ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:commutative-qou","label":"def:commutative-qou","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/commutative-qou.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}